  "description": "JOYSTAR Lomand Kids Bike - BMX Style for Ages 3-12\nFuel their sense of adventure with the JOYSTAR Lomand Kids Bike. Combining rugged BMX performance with essential safety features, this bike is designed to grow with your child from their first wobbly strides to confident neighborhood exploration.\n\nThe JOYSTAR Lomand in White: A perfect fit for young riders.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Crafted with premium, impact-resistant steel to withstand rough-and-tumble rides, jumps, and daily adventures.\"\nBuilt for Safety & Durability\nThe Lomand is constructed with a premium steel frame designed for long-lasting adventures. To ensure a protected riding experience, it features a dual V-brake system for reliable stopping and a half chain guard to keep little fingers safe.\n\nWide slip-resistant tires and dual V-brakes ensure a stable and protected ride.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nGrow-With-Me: Features an adjustable seat to accommodate your child's height as they grow.\n\nConfidence Builders: Includes stable training wheels to help beginners find their balance.\n\nBMX Styling: A sporty look that kids love, available in multiple colors including Blue, Black, and White.\n\nFull Accessory Kit: Comes standard with a bike bell, a cool rearview mirror, and essential tools.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nGet riding fast! The JOYSTAR Lomand arrives 85% pre-built. Most families complete the setup in approximately 15 to 20 minutes using the included tools.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSize data sourced from Lomand Fit Guide.\nEngineering Excellence\n\nDiscover the craftsmanship: Close-up look at the durable frame and performance components.\n\nOur Guarantee\nJOYSTAR stands behind every bike we build to ensure your child has a happy and safe riding experience.\n\nLimited Lifetime Warranty: This bicycle is backed by a limited lifetime warranty on the frame.\n\nExpert Support: Access to user guides and assembly help to keep your bike road-ready.\n\n30-Day Satisfaction: FREE 30-day refund or replacement for peace of mind.",
